re_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/ba4c5ef7f4140ce92c4969476f322483.webm?t=1762966351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/ba4c5ef7f4140ce92c4969476f322483.mp4?t=1762966351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear obstacles and plow to prepare your land for planting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically plan your crop layout for maximum efficiency and yields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture your plants - water, fertilize, and shield them from harm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reap your harvest and turn a profit, but watch out - Sir Landlord might drop by for his tax!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf83\u00a0Find the best combos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/d96afae9d3588a81083d298af800e6a4.poster.avif?t=1762966351\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/d96afae9d3588a81083d298af800e6a4.webm?t=1762966351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/d96afae9d3588a81083d298af800e6a4.mp4?t=1762966351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a variety of unique scarecrows with powerful perks and passives to supercharge your farming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different scarecrow combinations and create the ultimate synergy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck around their abilities or hunt for the perfect ones to complete your collection. The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25\u00a0Outsmart challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/6cdd93bd04c1a6cea17da364317ad16a.poster.avif?t=1762966351\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/6cdd93bd04c1a6cea17da364317ad16a.webm?t=1762966351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/6cdd93bd04c1a6cea17da364317ad16a.mp4?t=1762966351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing thunder, droughts, tornadoes, or even ice cubes? There ain\u2019t no rest for the farmer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave diverse biomes and adapt to unique hazards in every scenario.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your crops at all costs! Sir Landlord won\u2019t wait - he\u2019ll collect his tax rain or shine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2692\ufe0f\u00a0Craft your ideal deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/d10e7c5f57e8180f109f1f6c3c1a62a5.poster.avif?t=1762966351\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/d10e7c5f57e8180f109f1f6c3c1a62a5.webm?t=1762966351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/extras/d10e7c5f57e8180f109f1f6c3c1a62a5.mp4?t=1762966351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gems by completing levels and use them at the market to expand your card collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a risk with themed card packs or stick to safer picks from the seller\u2019s inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a card you don\u2019t need or a scarecrow that\u2019s not working for you? Remove them and keep your deck streamlined.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the forge, and upgrade your cards to the next level! Use copies to merge them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mad Head Bump"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3500680","name":"Cropdeck"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123850/106ed05e883433c91a0ccc3620db29e87ae6a356/header.jpg?t=1762966351","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture, 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ or Vulkan capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Works best on 16:9 monitors.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or x64 architecture with SSE2, 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available s